# Title: Use Short Name Path in Image
# ID: a96970af-f126-420d-90e1-d37bf25e50e1
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali
# Date: 2022-08-07
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
# Description: Detect use of the Windows 8.3 short name. Which could be used as a method to avoid Image detection
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*~1\\*" OR process_path="*~2\\*")) AND NOT (((((process_path="*\\AppData\\*" AND process_path="*\\Temp\\*")) OR ((process_path="*~1\\unzip.exe" OR process_path="*~1\\7zG.exe"))) OR ((parent_process_path="C:\\Windows\\System32\\Dism.exe" OR parent_process_path="C:\\Windows\\System32\\cleanmgr.exe")))) AND NOT ((((Product="InstallShield (R)") OR (Description="InstallShield (R) Setup Engine") OR (Company="InstallShield Software Corporation")) OR (parent_process_path="*\\thor\\thor64.exe") OR (parent_process_path="*\\WebEx\\WebexHost.exe"))))
